  One part of that tree is not a design port and has no upstream counterpart: the conservative repair
  pass (`repairReplacementBlock` in src/vendor/edits.ts, with its helpers findWrapSites, scanDelimiters,
  scanBlockStates, opensSomething, closesSomething, isFlushLeftBlock and pairIndent) is an ORIGINAL mpd
  implementation written for this repository, restoring by design a capability the replaced core had.
  No upstream source was read or copied for it.

